[{"title":"送杨梦莲从伯爵许军门东征凯旋加功归晋水","author":"章甫","text":"鹤翅摩天海外游，才名今已播瀛洲。\n几曾阃内参麾拥，独与行间驻笔筹。\n万丈将星回旧舍，十分春色送行舟。\n遥知白马金鞍跨，父老争看绣帽头。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2481,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"甲戌1814九月廿一夜予方有秋兴适奎垣以诗见贶清话更阑叠次其韵感赋二律 其一","author":"章甫","text":"悲秋搔首不胜簪，万籁无声秋气沉。\n世味尝来寒士淡，人情阅至老儒深。\n半生事业羞双鬓，千古文章共寸心。\n吾党风流云散后，几曾夜话到于今。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2482,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"甲戌1814九月廿一夜予方有秋兴适奎垣以诗见贶清话更阑叠次其韵感赋二律 其二","author":"章甫","text":"记得花枝各一簪，同门回首愧渊沉。\n笔枯自觉横军涩，绠短焉能汲古深。\n苦教儿孙如有志，学权子母又何心。\n谈天数及周天度，可获贞元起自今。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2483,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寿吴母刘太君七十","author":"章甫","text":"晓日神山现海滨，仙姬岛上认前身。\n请看歌乐传公子，原是然藜照老人。\n七十北堂开宴始，三千东阁赋诗频。\n苍松翠柏围帘幕，垂荫长盘太古春。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2484,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"叠寿吴母刘太君七十韵","author":"章甫","text":"鹤翎梳看水云滨，熟饭胡麻自在身。\n寿母的应留健者，弄孙真可乐安人。\n即今海屋添筹便，终古桑田种秫频。\n六出雪花来进酒，年年送腊又逢春。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2485,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"贺新婚","author":"章甫","text":"袖得芹香和粉奁，缠绵香息水痕黏。\n良缘有玉田中种，好事如花锦上添。\n琴瑟声调君子匹，熊罴梦叶大人占。\n仙郎此去秋光近，笑指姮娥戏桂蟾。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2486,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"与广文黄淡川话旧","author":"章甫","text":"而舅于予乃弟兄，才华早已耳声名。\n桂蟾秋月香闽峤，桃李春官烂帝城。\n两地隔江遥系念，一时航海话关情。\n瀛东道立尊师训，晋秩端应荷宠荣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2487,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"戊申1788春与诗人吴奇文邱瑞岚邱桂芳夜集袖琴亭刻烛分咏拈得中庸语大为题同人以莫载从何说起予窃以天地人物该之率成一律","author":"章甫","text":"何年气母大生成，语大无嫌肆大声。\n日月星辰天上系，江淮河汉地中行。\n传人立定千秋史，号物包罗万汇情。\n往古来今囊一笔，化工消息付诗评。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2488,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"贺陈握卿游泮","author":"章甫","text":"白沙理学世传芳，撷藻犹流翰墨香。\n五色笔花新吐艳，三条烛火看摇光。\n扬鬐出海经鲲化，振翮摩天极凤翔。\n珍重姮娥亲种桂，秋来攀与少年郎。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2489,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夜读","author":"章甫","text":"永夜无纷扰，孤灯对古人。\n天心怜守拙，还我读书身。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2490,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"问蝶 其一","author":"章甫","text":"业债为谁春，风流问夙因。\n云渠双粉翅，原是合花身。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2491,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"问蝶 其二","author":"章甫","text":"栩栩欲何之，寻春得意时。\n芳心浑是梦，物化漆园知。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2492,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"野寺","author":"章甫","text":"野寺半编茅，香烟久已抛。\n山僧寒补衲，懒把饭钟敲。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2493,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"病鹤","author":"章甫","text":"尔乃九皋禽，青天碧海心。\n可怜馀瘦骨，懒向海天吟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2494,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"岁暮客居有感","author":"章甫","text":"春夏秋冬客，琴书剑佩身。\n江湖劳卖拙，辜负故园春。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2495,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"清流港","author":"章甫","text":"是港号清流，渔人无到港。\n今兹倏尔来，或者闻持蚌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2496,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋夜怀友","author":"章甫","text":"伊人秋夜里，露白又葭苍。\n我有一方想，水云何处乡。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2497,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"弹琴","author":"章甫","text":"弦中山月照，弦外水云归。\n一曲邈天际，太音希不希。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2498,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"竹影","author":"章甫","text":"日上竿头早，风摇云影好。\n看他去化龙，且莫呼童扫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2499,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题兰若二画壁 其一","author":"章甫","text":"画龙不点睛，不是防飞去。\n尔乃抱珠眠，传神何定处。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2500,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题兰若二画壁 其二","author":"章甫","text":"画虎不图山，伏来今已久。\n皈依此结缘，肯复思嵎负。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2501,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"四时闺思 其一","author":"章甫","text":"觅睡寻春梦不能，心香一缕篆孤灯。\n频呼侍婢亭前看，月上花梢第几层。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2502,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"四时闺思 其二","author":"章甫","text":"纳凉销夏碧窗纱，懒扑流萤月影斜。\n步到荷池聊拨闷，无端并蒂忽开花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2503,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"四时闺思 其三","author":"章甫","text":"永夜深秋冷绣帏，不堪检点旧寒衣。\n铜壶滴尽霜钟响，惆怅金风又告归。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2504,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"四时闺思 其四","author":"章甫","text":"肃气穷冬分外严，支寒瘦骨锁眉尖。\n遥怜塞上今宵雪，似此妆楼几倍添。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2505,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"醉西施","author":"章甫","text":"浣纱一别入吴宫，白玉床前醉舞中。\n莫道情缘犹未了，香魂今已嫁秋风。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2506,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"胜娇莲","author":"章甫","text":"淡然君子洗芳心，万草千花烂不禁。\n一自冷香君占去，亭亭遗恨至于今。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2507,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"紫云洞","author":"章甫","text":"洞里幽泉澈底清，流澌总在石中行。\n潺潺不泻人间去，尽日閒吟世外声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2508,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"试剑石","author":"章甫","text":"火光迸裂直凌空，百战都从一试中。\n神物已随龙化去，石痕犹带古时雄。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2509,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台邑八景","author":"章甫","text":"鹿耳雄关障百川，晴帆连贯水中天。\n好风早晚东西便，送尽今来古往船。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2510,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台邑八景","author":"章甫","text":"渔父鲲沙傍海居，环流连络势相于。\n归来有客休弹铗，举网谁家不得鱼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2511,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台邑八景","author":"章甫","text":"濛濛洒落雁门前，几度风吹断复连。\n好景居然山水画，一重雨意一重烟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2512,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台邑八景","author":"章甫","text":"月印寒潭扫却云，水光月色两无分。\n渔舟夜唱天心处，风送歌声镜里闻。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2513,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台邑八景","author":"章甫","text":"东方既白唱金鸡，天半朱霞晓望齐。\n锦绣千端云外织，层层挂在海峰西。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2514,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台邑八景","author":"章甫","text":"赤嵌巧筑海天中，万水孤悬一镇雄。\n雉堞斜阳翻照影，满城烟火落江红。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2515,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台邑八景","author":"章甫","text":"香洋一片耨春时，有事西畴不敢迟。\n漫说夏耘今尚早，乱苗恶莠妙先期。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2516,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台邑八景","author":"章甫","text":"逢秋旗尾斗戎功，木落山沉马首雄。\n此日大蒐宜此地，天然赤帜战金风。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2517,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读桃源记","author":"章甫","text":"千古桃源记问津，奇传晋代捕渔人。\n后人要觅前人景，未审桃花肯复春。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2518,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"迷途逢野叟邀宿山中","author":"章甫","text":"一重山水一重沙，去此何之日已斜。\n曳杖忽来云外叟，相邀半榻伴烟霞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2519,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"午睡闻蝉","author":"章甫","text":"叶里低徊千百啭，风前断续两三声。\n纳凉醉客慵于我，分尔松阴午梦清。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2520,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"五色蝶","author":"章甫","text":"蛱蝶谁教五色妆，仙衣遗化采花香。\n春风得意归何处，认取罗浮是故乡。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2521,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"苏长公赏心十六事","author":"章甫","text":"一灯话尽古今长，竹雨幽窗夜未央。\n多少閒情多少趣，平分消受五更凉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2522,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"苏长公赏心十六事","author":"章甫","text":"浅水无波澈底清，好风吹送棹歌声。\n桃花夹岸随舟转，知渡仙津第几程。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2523,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"苏长公赏心十六事","author":"章甫","text":"朋侪握手且言欢，莫怪疏慵礼数宽。\n面目见真肝胆照，何须妆点著衣冠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2524,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"苏长公赏心十六事","author":"章甫","text":"风流陶谢杳无踪，开瓮偏酣酒兴浓。\n会曷不期来不速，饮中知己本相逢。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2525,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"苏长公赏心十六事","author":"章甫","text":"晨兴最好是名香，宝鸭炉头篆字长。\n夜气息馀空万有，芳心一缕结方将。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2526,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"苏长公赏心十六事","author":"章甫","text":"北窗倦睡纳风凉，藤枕冷然贴一方。\n唱午灵鸡休唤觉，幽人才梦世羲皇。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2527,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"苏长公赏心十六事","author":"章甫","text":"江边遥对数重峰，何处敲来饭后钟。\n岸上有僧来唤渡，始知寺被白云封。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2528,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"苏长公赏心十六事","author":"章甫","text":"横笛东邻随兴吹，倚楼听取月明时。\n要将三弄声声数，恰好姮娥共记之。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2529,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"苏长公赏心十六事","author":"章甫","text":"雨后登楼一望间，放开眼界莫教閒。\n云屏展拓清如洗，好数重重山外山。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2530,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"苏长公赏心十六事","author":"章甫","text":"濯足休誇万里流，但能涤暑便相投。\n直将无限炎威气，付与沧浪水面收。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2531,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哭仲山叔 其一","author":"章甫","text":"六十三年老典型，海天一夕陨文星。\n西风瑟瑟寒琴剑，肠断啼鹃血泪零。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2532,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哭仲山叔 其二","author":"章甫","text":"记得趋承愧比儿，兴宗远天日相期。\n只今犹未驰千里，空负龙文错爱时。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2533,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"蟹 其一","author":"章甫","text":"江湖使者草泥香，郭索横行得意扬。\n占得刚柔分外内，由来公子是无肠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2534,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"蟹 其二","author":"章甫","text":"玉质金相十二名，是谁吉梦应分明。\n传来奇绝都亭语，千古文章盖世横。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2535,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"渔樵耕牧 其一","author":"章甫","text":"渔翁荡漾水中天，最妙相忘不记筌。\n借问得鱼何妙趣，化机一半跃于渊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2536,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"渔樵耕牧 其二","author":"章甫","text":"樵夫踏碎碧云飞，伐木丁丁采四围。\n山上斜阳山下落，一肩挑尽晚霞归。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2537,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"渔樵耕牧 其三","author":"章甫","text":"耕夫出作亩南东，乐在青畦绿野中。\n箬笠蓑衣身计足，不愁雨燠不愁风。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2538,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"渔樵耕牧 其四","author":"章甫","text":"牧童刍牧是如何，或饮于池或降阿。\n醒眼不随人醉态，杏花村外自高歌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2539,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"仙翁沽酒图","author":"章甫","text":"步过溪南别有天，杏花村在白云边。\n仙翁贪醉个中景，解下杖头沽酒钱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2540,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"井亭夜市","author":"章甫","text":"井亭夜景闹如何，交易然灯几度过。\n不是日中违古制，海关口市晚来多。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2541,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"兰亭怀古","author":"章甫","text":"三月寻芳禊事脩，兰亭胜会几时休。\n春风流水多情者，犹向山阴忆旧游。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2542,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哭父 其一","author":"章甫","text":"惊号无状恨无穷，恸绝椿摧瀛岛东。\n昨晚春游归大梦，一场春梦一生空。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2543,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哭父 其二","author":"章甫","text":"愈呼返魄愈无知，惊报亲朋半信疑。\n恨却药汤全未奉，枉生养老读书儿。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2544,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哭父 其三","author":"章甫","text":"人言坐脱是仙归，无疾而终世所希。\n哀死慰生都以此，问天搔首是耶非。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2545,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哭父 其四","author":"章甫","text":"一方灵几一孤檠，半起幽风半灭明。\n更苦夜号添母痛，几回泣血忽吞声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2546,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哭父 其五","author":"章甫","text":"灯月无情烂不收，来朝佳节更悲愁。\n五城若弛金吾禁，魂在诸天何处游。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2547,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哭父 其六","author":"章甫","text":"万般惟觉读书珍，回首如闻夜读频。\n到老不知勤学苦，终身总是学中人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2548,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哭父 其七","author":"章甫","text":"承家十二世儒门，少教儿曹老教孙。\n翻觉放翁藏本少，检书何止一箱存。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2549,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哭父 其八","author":"章甫","text":"航海当年险海隅，盖棺今尽道真儒。\n也知正寝蒙天报，其奈椎心怙已无。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2550,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哭父 其九","author":"章甫","text":"六经都是手亲裁，三箧亡书苦记来。\n手泽不堪频抚卷，一回朗诵一回哀。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2551,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哭父 其十","author":"章甫","text":"每把双闱动辄思，肯因白首坠青云。\n伤心遗训随流水，空树文坛早冠军。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2552,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哭父 其十一","author":"章甫","text":"顿尽名心愿已虚，显扬望后又何如。\n未能禄养荣封典，有子空教读父书。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2553,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哭父 其十二","author":"章甫","text":"斑斑血洒哭诗章，六十二年胡遽亡。\n生我靡瞻今已矣，长眠遥在白云乡。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2554,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哭母 其一","author":"章甫","text":"自从失怙泪痕零，待罪萱堂仅五龄。\n大化忽催归大暮，呼天怆地不堪听。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2555,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哭母 其二","author":"章甫","text":"亡母非如亡父时，曾经问卜亦求医。\n而今始觉阴阳数，药石无功卦象知。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2556,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哭母 其三","author":"章甫","text":"一去幽冥百事非，朔风摇撼冷慈帏。\n声声泣下星星血，肠断今朝又靡依。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2557,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哭母 其四","author":"章甫","text":"育儿善病近中年，七十延龄亦有天。\n尽道寿高休恸绝，但思鞠我便凄然。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2558,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]